MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* Initial plan

* feat: add Developer Console with Prompt Pane, Live Coder Pane, and /dev-console route

- Add useAdminAuth hook for admin role checking via NEXT_PUBLIC_ADMIN_EMAILS
- Add ConfirmationModal component for destructive action confirmation
- Add DevConsoleHeader with auth status and connection indicator
- Add PromptPane (40%) with quick/advanced prompt, templates, history, agent integration
- Add LiveCoderPane (60%) with Monaco editor, file path input, diagnostics, sandboxed iframe preview
- Add DevConsole main component with drag, resize, Ctrl/Cmd+` toggle, admin gate
- Add /dev-console demo route page with feature documentation

Co-authored-by: CubiqoUnited <239777378+CubiqoUnited@users.noreply.github.com>

* fix: address code review feedback — severity constant, UUID for IDs, key prop for LiveCoderPane

Co-authored-by: CubiqoUnited <239777378+CubiqoUnited@users.noreply.github.com>

