+## Technology Stack
+
+```
+Frontend:
+  - Next.js 16.0.3 (App Router)
+  - React 19 RC + TypeScript 5.x
+  - React Three Fiber 9.4.0 (3D cube)
+  - Tailwind CSS 4.x
+  - Web Speech API (voice)
