+- **[BRANCHES_QUICK_REF.md](./BRANCHES_QUICK_REF.md)** - Quick reference for branches
+- **[AUTH_TROUBLESHOOTING.md](./AUTH_TROUBLESHOOTING.md)** - Authentication troubleshooting
